BRepClass3d: the classification of a point against a solid
(BRepClass3d_SClassifier::Perform) mapped every edge of the solid to its
faces for every point, though the map is read only where the line through
the point passes through an edge. Against a solid of thousands of faces,
making and freeing that map took most of each point's classification: the
placement of a union's cavities (BOPAlgo_BuilderSolid) and the checker's
test of a solid's shells (BRepCheck_Solid) classify tens of points against
such a solid (mitcad#1279). The map is now made the first time it is read.
The results are unchanged.
